FTXUI 7.0.3 (amalgamated release asset), used by the learndc terminal UI.

Upstream:  https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/FTXUI
Release:   https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/FTXUI/releases/tag/v7.0.3
Asset:     https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/FTXUI/releases/download/v7.0.3/ftxui-amalgamated.zip
SHA-256:   63d13bb65747bdbf0edf04d83ce490708022371cf378f15fad8489249ea4fd9a
License:   MIT, see LICENSE in this directory (also shipped with learndc).

The zip is committed unchanged. learndc/tools/extract_ftxui.py verifies the
checksum and extracts ftxui.hpp and ftxui.cpp into the build directory; the
sources are not edited. To update, replace the zip, the checksum here and in
learndc/GNUmakefile, and rebuild.
